    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu akatishawu makutwa, hela wachikeka, hela aketulawuwusonyi windi, kwijila muchipompelu chaYehova nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wamuchiŋuta kwijila muchipompelu chaYehova nehi; helakwikipu dekumi mwanindi kwijila muchipompelu chaYehova nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KaAmoni hela kaMowabi kwipila muchipompelu chaYehova nehi; hela kwikiŋu dekumi hosi wawu wamba keŋila muchipompelu chaYehovaku hayanyaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa abulili kuyikinkilila nayakudya nameji munjila himwa fumini muEjipitu; muŋa akukwatilili Balami mwana kaBeyori wakuPetori mukala wamuMesopotamiya kulonda akakushiŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, Yehova Nzambi yeyi hamutiyililili Balamuku; Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakubalumwinini ishiŋu hidikwikala nkisu, muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakukeŋeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakayila jakuyikwasha kumona kumwena hela jakumona kuhetaku nyaka yeyi yejima haya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakamúumba kaEdomuku, muŋa himana kweyi; bayi wakamúumba kaEjipituku, muloŋa eyi wadiŋi mwenyi mwituŋa dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanawu akavwalawu akwikiŋu damu chisatu akeŋilaŋa tuhu muchipompelu chaYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakayaŋa muchilombu chakudasa njita nawayilumbu jeyi wakadi hembaŋa kuyuma yatama yejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi hakachi kenu hakekala iyala nabuli kujila nansaŋu jina muwaninawufuku, akafumi hachilombu, bayi akenza muchilombuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chikwila melela hiyakutachika, akaweli mumeji, chidikuholoka itaŋwa hakwinza cheŋi muchilombu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunsa yachilombu wakekalaŋa neluŋa dakuyilaŋa kumpata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayuma yeyi yakwasa nachu njita wakekalaŋa nakafwosholu kulonda chiwakayaŋa nakushakama kumpata wakapundaŋa nachu, wakabalumukicheŋi nakushikila yikufuma mudeyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi hakwendujola muchilombu cheyi kulonda akupulwishaŋa, akwinkaŋa ayilumbu jeyi kuwukuyaŋa; dichi chilombu cheyi chakekalaŋa chajila, kulonda akabulaŋa kumona mudeyi chuma chamajilu, wakenza kakufuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nduŋu napuluki kudi nkaka yindi nenzi kudeyi bayi wakamufuntisha cheŋi kudi nkaka yinduku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akashakamaŋa naneyi mukachi kenu, hamukalaweyi wumu, kwonsu kwakatondayi kwanamoniyi kuwaha; bayi wakamukabishaŋaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadi anyana kaIsarela awambanda bayi hakekalaŋa kabolaku, hela hadianyana kaIsarela amayala bayi hakekalaŋa akwilaŋa wutumwaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitala dayehova Nzambi yeyi kuletamu nyondamu yachivumbi, hela ndanduyakawa hiwukuhana hansaŋu yakudishiila, chinjila; muloŋa yejimiyi yiyedi kudi Yehova Nzambi yeyi hikushimana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusondamisha mana kweyi chakudiilamu nŋalanyi chinjila, hela tuhuhinŋalanyi yamali, hela tuhu hinŋalanyi yayuma yakudya, hela tuhu hinŋalanyiyachuma hichuma chasondamishaŋawu chakudiilamu nŋalanyi, chinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakwacheŋi wukutwesha tuhu kumusondamisha chakudiilamu nŋalanyi; kwinza mana kweyi kumusondamisha chakudiila munŋalanyi chinjila; kulonda Yehova Nzambi yeyi akakukoolekeshi muyumayejima yiwakakwata chikasa mwituŋa diwakaya nakuheta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakadishiila kumwinka Yehova Nzambi yeyi chuma, bayi wakalabajala kuchihanaku, muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakachikeŋa kudeyi; chakenza kakubalumukila hinshidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi wakaleka kudishiila hichakekala nshidi kudeyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuma chikufuma kukanwa keyi chiŋa wakashaku muchima nakwilamu; muwadishiilili kumwinka Yehova Nzambi yeyi, hihimulambu wakulambula chakumuchima weyeyi aweni wamukanininakanwa keyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
